# pixi working directory — environments, task cache and the local
# `config.toml` that detaches those environments to
# C:/python-environments/pixi/envs. pixi writes its own `.pixi/.gitignore`
# holding `*` as well; this entry is what covers the directory before the
# first `pixi install` has run. pixi.lock itself IS tracked.
.pixi/

